<title>UK: UK's Airtours gains after strong results.</title>
<headline>UK's Airtours gains after strong results.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Airtours Plc nudged higher in pre-market trading on Wednesday after the company posted a better-than-expected 46 percent rise in yearly profits and said summer bookings were running well ahead of last year.</p>
<p>The stock was up 3-1/2p at 706-1/2 by 0816 GMT after having already risen 25p in the past two sessions.</p>
</text>
